    <string name="profile_info_title">What\'s a token?</string>
    <string name="profile_info_body">A token is a local device profile instead of an account. It is created on the phone and never leaves it: no sign-up, no link to RuStore. Its name and look are generated from a random seed, and you can change the motif, colour and frame at any time.</string>
